  "notes": "仅展示该手册的结构示例，保留其 jalr 写法；此处未定义完整立即数拆分与重定位，不作为通用汇编器展开规则。x7 会被改写；地址必须来自目标符号的 PC 相对或绝对偏移。",
  "notesEn": "Structural examples from this manual only, retaining its jalr notation. The passage does not specify complete immediate splitting or relocations; this is not a universal assembler expansion rule. x7 is clobbered; the address must derive from a PC-relative or absolute symbol offset.",
  "expansions": [
    {
      "syntax": "tail offset",
      "condition": "PC 相对地址示例",
      "conditionEn": "PC-relative address example",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "auipc",
          "assembly": "auipc x7, imm20"
        },
        {
          "name": "jalr",
          "assembly": "jalr x0, x7"
        }
      ],
      "clobbers": [
        "x7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "syntax": "tail offset",
      "condition": "绝对地址示例",
      "conditionEn": "Absolute address example",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "lui",
          "assembly": "lui x7, imm20"
        },
        {
          "name": "jalr",
          "assembly": "jalr x0, x7"
        }
      ],
      "clobbers": [
